    # goatguard "Really? From that far away?"
    goatguard "真的？那么远的地方？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c11b20bb:

    # e "Yes, I just need a direction, and then I'll go."
    e "是的，我只需要有人指个方向，然后就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_2034511c:

    # goatguard "Alright, sure."
    goatguard "好吧，行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e0848d29:

    # e "Mhmm I want to go to..." nointeract
    e "嗯，我想去……" nointeract

