    # e "I don't know I need a map at least so I won't get lost again, Please?"
    e "我不知道。我至少需要一张地图，这样就不会再迷路了，可以吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_9e9dc0b8:

    # e "the Town?"
    e "城里？"

