    # e "Yes, but I don't know where I am... Please?"
    e "是的，但我不知道自己现在在哪儿……拜托？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_fa2c7940:

    # goatguard "The town? It's really far away."
    goatguard "城里？那可远着呢。"

